{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03393","headline":"桂州陪王都督晦日宴逍遥楼 · 宋之问","name":"桂州陪王都督晦日宴逍遥楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晦节高楼望，山川一半春。\n意随蓂叶尽，愁共柳条新。\n投刺登龙日，开怀纳鸟晨。\n兀然心似醉，不觉有吾身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}